epfl.ch/record/149056"}, {"title": "IMU Bulletin no. 42, Special Issue, July 1998", "url": "https://www.mathunion.org/fileadmin/IMU/Publications/Bulletins/1994_1999/42/report.html"}, {"title": "library.iut.ac.ir", "url": "https://library.iut.ac.ir/Inventory/100/23615.htm"}]}, "The 1994 International Congress of Mathematicians was held in Zürich, Switzerland. The sources agree on the dates, August 3 to 11, 1994.\n\n- **Venue:** The lectures were planned for the city's Kongresshaus, plus lecture theatres at ETH Zürich and the University of Zurich. The lectures will be held at the Kongresshaus of the city of Zurich and in lecture theatres at the Federal Institute of Technology (ETHZ) and at the University of Zurich. A later IMU report says the opening ceremony took place in the Congress Hall in Zürich.\n- **Attendance:** A report by the congress president, Henri Carnal, counts 2,536 participants from 87 countries, plus 363 accompanying members and 77 publishing exhibitors (webdoc.gwdg.de, IMU Bulletin 37).\n- **Context:** The IMU General Assembly met shortly before, in Lucerne, on July 31 to August 1, 1994. It chose Berlin as the site of the 1998 Congress.\n- **Proceedings:** Published by Birkhäuser in two volumes, edited by S. D. Chatterji (mathunion.org)."], "durationSeconds": 5.679185250000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01Q9TDAUkPz6Gamb5rgiBE8R", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
